or later. The complete GPL version 3 text is available on Debian systems
in /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3.

The embedded fonts are distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Their copyright notices, source attributions, and full license text are
installed with libpress1 in /usr/share/doc/libpress1/OFL.txt. The source
tree also contains the individual upstream notices under fonts/vendor/.
The vendored Font Awesome SCSS name list has a separate MIT license
recorded in fonts/vendor/font-awesome/LICENSE-scss.txt.
